    serialized, resolving a warning that was previously logged to the console in
    Unity 6000.6.0a5 or newer.\n* Fixed `CameraTargetTextureFactory` so that it no
    longer logs an error related to releasing render texture that is set as Camera.targetTexture.\n\n###
